<body>
<div class="topline">BARAJAS SUPPLY · AUTOMOTIVE STYLE, YOUR WAY</div>
<header class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="#home">BARAJAS <span>SUPPLY</span></a><nav class="navlinks"><a href="#shop">Shop</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#details">Store info</a></nav><button class="cartbtn" id="cartToggle">CART (<span id="cartCount">0</span>)</button></header>
<aside class="cartpanel" id="cartPanel" aria-live="polite"><div class="carttop"><strong>YOUR CART</strong><button class="close" id="closeCart" aria-label="Close cart">×</button></div><div class="cartitems" id="cartItems">Your cart is empty.</div><button class="btn checkout" id="checkout">CHECKOUT</button><p class="smallprint">Preview store only. Checkout is not connected to a payment provider yet.</p></aside>
<main id="home">
<section class="wrap hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR YOUR RIDE</div><h1>UPGRADE<br>YOUR <em>RIDE.</em></h1><p>Car accessories to bring more personality to every drive. Discover your next interior upgrade with Barajas Supply.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#shop">SHOP THE DROP</a><a class="btn secondary" href="#about">OUR BRAND</a></div></div><div class="logo-frame"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Barajas Supply chrome automotive logo"></div></section>
<div class="strip">CAR CULTURE &nbsp; / &nbsp; PERSONAL STYLE &nbsp; / &nbsp; EVERYDAY UPGRADES</div>
<section class="wrap section" id="shop"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="eyebrow">FEATURED PICKS</div><h2>THE STARTING LINEUP</h2></div><p class="muted">A first look at the Barajas Supply collection.</p></div>
<div class="products">
<article class="product"><div class="product-art"><div class="lightbar" aria-label="Illustration of blue ambient LED lighting"></div></div><div class="productinfo"><div class="tag">INTERIOR · FEATURED</div><h3>RGB Interior LED Kit</h3><p>Multicolor ambient lighting concept for a personalized cabin vibe.</p><div class="price-row"><span class="price">$19.99*</span><button class="add" data-product="RGB Interior LED Kit" data-price="19.99">ADD TO CART +</button></div></div></article>
<article class="product"><div class="product-art"><div class="lightbar" aria-label="Illustration of white ambient LED lighting"></div></div><div class="productinfo"><div class="tag">INTERIOR · STYLE</div><h3>White Ambient Light Kit</h3><p>A clean, understated lighting look for your interior.</p><div class="price-row"><span class="price">COMING SOON</span><button class="add" data-product="White Ambient Light Kit" data-price="0">GET UPDATES</button></div></div></article>
<article class="product"><div class="product-art"><div class="lightbar" aria-label="Illustration of pink ambient LED lighting"></div></div><div class="productinfo"><div class="tag">INTERIOR · STYLE</div><h3>Color Mood Light Kit</h3><p>Explore colorful lighting options to match your personal style.</p><div class="price-row"><span class="price">COMING SOON</span><button class="add" data-product="Color Mood Light Kit" data-price="0">GET UPDATES</button></div></div></article>
</div><p class="notice">*Demo listing and suggested price only. Product availability, specifications, compatibility, shipping, and final price have not been verified. The lighting artwork is illustrative, not a photo of a confirmed product.</p></section>
<section class="wrap section" id="about"><div class="about"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE BARJAS STANDARD</div><div class="aboutmark">YOUR RIDE.<br>YOUR STYLE.</div></div><div><h2>Make it yours.</h2><p class="muted">Barajas Supply is being built for drivers who want to add their own touch to their cars, one accessory at a time. Clean look. Bold identity. Automotive-inspired details.</p><div class="features"><div class="feature"><strong>CURATED STYLE</strong><span>Accessories picked for the look.</span></div><div class="feature"><strong>STRAIGHTFORWARD</strong><span>Clear product details before you buy.</span></div><div class="feature"><strong>BUILT TO GROW</strong><span>More categories coming soon.</span></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section" id="details"><div class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU ORDER</div><h2>Store information</h2><p class="muted">This is a storefront preview. Add your verified shipping policy, returns policy, contact method, supplier details, and real product photos before opening it to customers. Never advertise delivery times or product features you haven't confirmed.</p></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footrow"><span>© <span id="year"></span> BARAJAS SUPPLY</span><span>UPGRADE YOUR RIDE.</span><span>Store preview · Not accepting live orders</span></div></footer>
<script>
const cart=[];const panel=document.getElementById('cartPanel');const items=document.getElementById('cartItems');const count=document.getElementById('cartCount');
function renderCart(){count.textContent=cart.length;if(!cart.length){items.textContent='Your cart is empty.';return;}items.innerHTML=cart.map((x,i)=>`<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #333"><span>${x.name}</span><span>$${x.price.toFixed(2)} <button aria-label="Remove ${x.name}" data-remove="${i}" style="background:none;color:#aaa;border:0">×</button></span></div>`).join('')+`<p style="text-align:right"><strong>Subtotal: $${cart.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.price,0).toFixed(2)}</strong></p>`;items.querySelectorAll('[data-remove]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{cart.splice(Number(b.dataset.remove),1);renderCart()}));}
document.getElementById('cartToggle').addEventListener('click',()=>panel.classList.toggle('open'));document.getElementById('closeCart').addEventListener('click',()=>panel.classList.remove('open'));
document.querySelectorAll('.add').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(b.dataset.price==='0'){alert('This item is not available yet. Add a real product and contact method before launch.');return;}cart.push({name:b.dataset.product,price:Number(b.dataset.price)});renderCart();panel.classList.add('open')}));
document.getElementById('checkout').addEventListener('click',()=>alert('This is a preview website. To accept orders, connect a checkout/payment provider and verify your product, supplier, shipping, and policies first.'));
document.getElementById('year').textContent=new Date().getFullYear();
</script></body></html>
